OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, with clear spells. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickening in the early hours, with
OL,8,Ffurther occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Farriving late in the night. Winds
OL,10,Fbecoming strong overnight, especially
OL,11,Fon coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FEarly rain clearing around
OL,14,Fmid-morning, then a brighter day with
OL,15,Fsunny spells, perhaps with an isolated
OL,16,Fblustery shower. Winds gradually
OL,17,Feasing.
